Title: Kaleidoscope Pro Master File Pipeline for Bat Acoustic Data
Version: 2.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Your", "Name", , "your.email@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A robust, modular workflow for standardizing Kaleidoscope Pro 
    acoustic detection CSVs into analysis-ready datasets. Handles mixed schema 
    versions, detector mapping, timezone conversion, and generates comprehensive 
    reports with full reproducibility and audit trails. Designed for bat 
    acoustic monitoring projects.
